"197022":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffd6ae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx197022-Gs7n9bAcnlL0.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx197022-Gs7n9bAcnlL0.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx197022-Gs7n9bAcnlL0.jpg"},"description":"Elizabeth was known as a villainess but in fact, she was a decent and honest girl. But she was accused by mistake, found guilty and exiled...but she accepted her situation. That was because...she had her memory from her previous life as an event planner in Japan, and she knew what was coming. She was in the Otome game world she loved!! She started enjoying her life as an apprentice to sisters at Church of Nortia which is located in a rural village. And she doesn't have to follow the story from here!! Now Elizabeth can using her skill from her previous life, to make her life easier. No one's noticing, so this will be OK, right? But then, the knight commander moves close and tells her he's watching. What does he want?<br><br>\n\n(Source: Kadokawa)\n\n","favourites":6,"genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":197022,"idMal":62187,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"popularity":968,"source":"LIGHT_NOVEL","status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","synonyms":["The Banished Villainess! Living the Leisurely Life of a Nun Making Revolutionary Church Food"],"tags":[{"id":857,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Villainess","rank":79},{"id":244,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Isekai","rank":60},{"id":614,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Nun","rank":60},{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":20},{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":20}],"title":{"native":"悪役令嬢の追放後！ 教会改革ごはんで悠々シスター暮らし","romaji":"Akuyaku Reijou no Tsuihougo! Kyoukai Kaikaku Gohan de Yuuyuu Sister Kurashii"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793052161},
"197094":{"averageScore":66,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#4378e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b197094-PrIYsM8fZ3bT.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b197094-PrIYsM8fZ3bT.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b197094-PrIYsM8fZ3bT.png"},"description":"He is lost in every possible sense, on every possible subject, including (but not limited to): how much space there is left in the Spirit Origin Storage, when one should use an item that looks kind of important, or even what the daily special is today.\n<br><br>\nThe slapstick anime where Fujimaru’s naive questions throw the Heroic Spirits into turmoil returns for that trick!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official Website)","duration":2,"endDate":{"day":17,"month":12,"year":2025},"episodes":24,"favourites":6,"format":"ONA","genres":["Comedy"],"id":197094,"idMal":62149,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":70,"popularity":697,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2025,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":1,"month":8,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":276,"name":"DLE"}],"synonyms":["Fate/Grand Order: You've Lost Ritsuka Fujimaru Season 3"],"tags":[{"id":83,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Slapstick","rank":79},{"id":82,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79},{"id":193,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Episodic","rank":79},{"id":164,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Tsundere","rank":79},{"id":105,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79},{"id":29,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Magic","rank":79},{"id":224,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Dragons","rank":79},{"id":534,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Werewolf","rank":79},{"id":251,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Archery","rank":79},{"id":1537,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Coastal","rank":79},{"id":305,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Ships","rank":79},{"id":632,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Centaur","ran